        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In Oijen (Oyen, former lordship, present day part of the community of Oss, province of Noord-Brabant, the Netherlands), presumably coins were produced in the period 1380-1390.</skos:definition>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://wiki.muntenenpapiergeld.nl/index.php?title=Muntplaatsen"/>
